Z||000000||1FST2M6||01-28-2001||11:26 AM||||Thanks everyone for thier supports and kind words! While i was in Mich. Brent (Tigger) and i hooked up.. we were on our way home and called him. it had snowed another 2-3" and he couldn't get his car shoveled out of storage..  and mine looked like Fidos @$$ all salt covered and nasty. we hung out with His father at McD's for about an hour...  Brent fabricated a KILLER looking scoopr for the side of the car... i  picked one up from him and i'll be posting pics and dyno results in the next few weeks. thanks for a great lunch and glad we could hook up!<P>OH for ANYONE wanting to lower their car in ANY northern state with crappy roads/ice/snow what ever DON"T DO IT! my car rides like a dream on kentucky and Ga. rd.. TN, OH, and MI roads SUCK some serious @$$! i REALLLY supprised that i didn't kill a wheels or thrash a tire! <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
